.png", "id": "2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pCuf0ei2JDwQ7kNvwEmtEou&_nc_oc=AdnFA8y4OlE-v8q5DWPpNiuAtmA1KD1s-AWUqZcgqyg0Q634w9g3nUXh3nvbs-s2xUM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfznAlu7D6ntNNrhH3YOgIlKtIcrEwLvVoz4VQAmGSxaqg&oe=69AAE137"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mOkg3ga4D7oQ7kNvwGvDzW1&_nc_oc=AdlngPAzY-RgTLE2Mg1ne1gOuvTxSm1JkEpVOVdOxjijwtUZ9o_FheOke1bqd1u7QsM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzjRfskdsh63XtlxFx0-h-8kHuJnqdUCXBiiRAIOPxsNA&oe=69AAE2CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sdZ8v2dFnKYQ7kNvwG7VP10&_nc_oc=AdngXo9Mw-b-nL3IgYGavda1PIlakxSknLeHJNMMdXk5StHmD9oURNtpulE2Epvk7SU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx8nqYfFaRSMEq_HWWUueLPjVaWKnIrMCNKsqBmHQ7l9g&oe=69AACFEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hU9bRK2q_LcQ7kNvwGQSf1C&_nc_oc=Adkjuy7LVepLN7DVyGV0HzWJ1CbsV6jkBiJocJef2sfoiE9novJ_eJ874fecxhcYDhg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxh24NQ5ShYhSOI7WXigUM7DP8ETrHW4nrXoFDIct_btQ&oe=69AAB943"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2LfY5Ia1QvAQ7kNvwHCAUa4&_nc_oc=AdlYmOt-pW6rfD0yVRhCHeR7eGXG_1nK6rmNmcRuKWVHacbdMdVUbiC4PX6yNe0OhhA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwRPg8uz4BymjOv4sXs3MDMDQFF7JM5PokZ1C887e5Dxw&oe=69AAB198"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7xbrxRs_CDEQ7kNvwFbgyZm&_nc_oc=AdloIRHmVzKohlMVlrKYGF_YUlxXwpWIe7lTo7r1siqzuYT50XEQxqtwpvUFcjBPZdI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwa8vzGv__q3_qOxOtHR8jIvXkNB5FP2O8V0FE3k2CAZQ&oe=69AAC4BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440